  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> We Stand for Smart Progress </h2>",
   "body": "<p><strong>Do you want to speed up your work processes? Then take the shortcut for tool measurement and inspection. The ZOLLER »pomBasic« series is the ideal solution for well-thought-out, economically structured preparation and production of precision tools.</strong></p> <p>Save yourself unnecessary trips to the measuring room and benefit from efficient processes and precise results in record time. With their compact dimensions, the ZOLLER »pomBasic« inspection machines can be positioned anywhere in your production – directly next to the CNC grinding machine, in the goods receipt area or at the tool issue.</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/in/company/contact-us\">Request now</a> <a href=\"https://myzoller.com/us/en/expert/booking/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">1:1 expert meeting</a></p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/f/3/csm_Smart-fortschritt_f5aa67f87d.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 1454,
     "h": 1454
    }
   ],
   "videos": [],
   "pos": "right",
   "cols": 1,
   "valign": "center",
   "ftype": "textmedia",
   "id": "c2174",
   "bg": "black",
   "space": {
    "before": "default",
    "after": "default"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "",
   "body": "<p>Calibrating measuring devices on site with certified test specimens and reference standards is an important part of quality assurance at E. ZOLLER GmbH &amp; Co. KG - this is how we guarantee reliable measurement results and the high precision of your products in accordance with applicable standards.</p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/b/f/csm_zertifizierung_pombasic_en_72bea1d048.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 1699,
