  {
   "type": "hotspots",
   "header": "<h2> Compactness in the details </h2>",
   "intro": "",
   "img": {
    "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/5/a/csm_pomBasic_update_infodots_149a443d10.webp",
    "alt": "",
    "w": 1213,
    "h": 1259
   },
   "spots": [
    {
     "x": 32.584,
     "y": 7.482,
     "label": "»pomSoft 2« software",
     "text": "<h3>»pomSoft 2« software</h3> <h4>»pomSoft 2« Software</h4> <p>The »pomSoft 2« software is intuitive, user-friendly, and enables operators to perform reliable measurements. The 24\" TFT color monitor meets industry standards and is integrated directly into the device.</p>"
    },
    {
     "x": 50.415,
     "y": 31.388,
     "label": "Reflected-light camera",
     "text": "<h3>Reflected-light camera</h3> <h4>Reflected-light camera</h4> <p>Reflected-light camera – available with an axis that can be manually fine-tuned or, depending on the application, additionally CNC-controlled. Depending on the model, a color camera with zoom lens, a monochrome camera with fixed aperture, or a monochrome camera with zoom lens is available for micro-tool inspection.</p>"
    },
    {
     "x": 29.213,
     "y": 31.812,
     "label": "Additional lighting",
     "text": "<h3>Additional lighting</h3> <h4>Supplementary lighting</h4> <p>Additional lighting – enables transmitted light measurement in the peripheral area. This allows for the measurement of outer contours, step lengths, peak angles, and much more.</p>"
    },
    {
     "x": 25.11,
     "y": 48.141,
     "label": "Mouse and keyboard tray",
     "text": "<h3>Mouse and keyboard tray</h3> <h4>Mouse and Keyboard Tray</h4> <p>Mouse and keyboard tray – a space-saving, pull-out drawer ergonomically positioned under the desk.</p>"
    },
    {
     "x": 26.282,
     "y": 69.976,
     "label": "Color laser printer",
     "text": "<h3>Color laser printer</h3> <h4>Color laser printer</h4> <p>Color laser printer – ideal for printing reports and lists, it fits perfectly under the desk.</p>"
    },
    {
     "x": 73.913,
     "y": 14.588,
     "label": "Drawing holder",
     "text": "<h3>Drawing holder</h3> <h4>Drawing Holder</h4> <p>Drawing holder – ideal for positioning drawings in close proximity to the measuring area. The magnetic ball joint allows for flexible adjustment to the optimal position for the operator. Magnets make it easy to secure the drawings and change them quickly.</p>"
    },
    {
     "x": 63.361,
     "y": 29.082,
     "label": "Manual fine adjustment",
     "text": "<h3>Manual fine adjustment</h3> <h4>Manual fine adjustment of the X and Y axes</h4> <p>Manual fine adjustment of the X and Y axes – is sensitive and backlash-free, making it ideal for process-oriented tool measurement.</p>"
    },
    {
     "x": 44.895,
     "y": 30.071,
     "label": "»pomLightTube«",
     "text": "<h3>»pomLightTube«</h3> <h4>»pomLightTube« Auxiliary Lighting</h4> <p>»pomLightTube« auxiliary lighting – uses the LED lighting tunnel to provide high-contrast illumination of the tool cutting edge in reflected light. Additionally, spot lighting can be optionally installed to perfectly illuminate hidden tool geometries.</p>"
    },
    {
     "x": 64.875,
     "y": 55.153,
     "label": "Document and accessory tray",
     "text": "<h3>Document and accessory tray</h3> <h4>Document and accessory tray</h4> <p>Document and accessory tray – located under the desk, it offers ample storage space and convenient access to your documents and accessories.</p>"
    }
   ],
