  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> Measuring Saw Blades Tooth by Tooth </h2>",
   "body": "<p>The saw blade holder extends the range of applications for »pomBasic«. It can be used to clamp saw blades with a diameter of 150 mm to 600 mm with corresponding reduction rings.</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"#c3763\">Image processing »pomSoft 2«</a> <a class=\"btn\" href=\"/fileadmin/02_Products/pomBasic/ZOLLER_pomBasic_swivel-table.pdf\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">ZOLLER swivel table</a></p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/4/1/csm_Zahn-um-zahn_1286053bea.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 1454,
     "h": 1992
    }
   ],
   "videos": [],
   "pos": "right",
   "cols": 1,
   "valign": "center",
