  {
   "type": "overlay",
   "img": {
    "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/4/3/csm_Zahn-um-zahn-radialaxial_en_ba3675ead7.webp",
    "alt": "",
    "w": 996,
    "h": 870
   },
   "title": "»pomSoft 2«",
   "text": "<p>With »pomSoft 2« image processing, a large number of parameters and geometries on the teeth of the saw blades can be determined axially and radially in incident light.</p>",
   "ftype": "zoller_overlay",
   "id": "c3763",
   "bg": "",
   "space": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> The Fact Check for Tools </h2>",
   "body": "<p>A ZOLLER »pomBasic« is simple, fast, and safe to use – three unbeatable strengths that couldn’t be more accurate. But its design also provides the foundation for exact measurements: The arrangement of the linear axes and the integrated cable routing, with the resulting ergonomics and durability, are unique in the market.</p> <p>The ZOLLER Inspection &amp; Measuring solution proves what many claim: quality. </p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/in/solutions/inspection-measuring\">More about Inspection &amp; Measuring</a></p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/3/3/csm_pombasic_versprechen_b4a087dd41.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 1454,
