  },
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> Tool Inspection – Well Thought Through </h2>",
   "body": "<p>Wizard-guided measuring sequences, seamless inspection reports at the touch of a button and the tool-specific management of all parameters in the z.One central ZOLLER tool database ensure efficient production processes and traceable quality at all times.</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/in/company/contact-us\">Request now</a> <a class=\"btn\" href=\"https://myzoller.com/us/en/expert/booking/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">1:1 expert meeting</a></p>",
